{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465080/extras/5a42c05cd7f9aeb84c1ad4386b8a67c4.avif?t=1745642842\" width=593 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udca5Dungeons Bomb - Arcade Chaos Meets Explosive Fun!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeons Bomb is a fast-paced, arcade-style blast-fest for 1 to 4 players. Whether you're teaming up locally or connecting online, you'll be chasing high scores and blowing up the competition across multiple exciting game modes!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde8 <strong>CHALLENGE MODE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go solo or team up with friends to push your skills to the limit. Race against time, chain your combos, and set a new high score!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca3 <strong>DEATHMATCH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pure chaos. Pure fun. Outblast your friends in a bomb-filled brawl. Most eliminations wins\u2014watch the timer!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc51 <strong>BATTLE ROYALE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only one will survive. Drop into the arena and outsmart, outbomb, and outlast everyone else!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>HUNT CHALLENGE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharpen your aim\u2014this is a monster-slaying showdown! Compete to rack up the most kills before the round ends.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>COLOR BATTLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Territory takes tactics. Place bombs to claim the ground in your color. The player with the most covered area wins the match!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca1 <i>Explosive action, party-game vibes, and tons of replay value\u2014Dungeons Bomb is easy to pick up and impossible to put down.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Gameplay Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeons Bomb</strong> combines the nostalgic charm of arcade classics with fast-paced, strategic gameplay that keeps players on their toes. Drop into maze-like dungeons, place bombs, collect power-ups, and outmaneuver both monsters and friends in a series of chaotic game modes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll dodge explosions, trap enemies, and use clever tactics to gain the upper hand\u2014whether you\u2019re hunting high scores or competing in a last-player-standing battle. The controls are simple, but the action ramps up quickly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465080/extras/5f63add50f30e135974f87e1acc061bb.poster.avif?t=1745642842\" width=448 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465080/extras/5f63add50f30e135974f87e1acc061bb.webm?t=1745642842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465080/extras/5f63add50f30e135974f87e1acc061bb.mp4?t=1745642842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Default  Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start the game with 8 colorful default characters\u2014each represented by a bold color and ready to dive into the action. These vibrant variations help players quickly identify themselves in the chaos, making them perfect for local or online multiplayer fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465080/extras/9f806ec11890885afc9d8be5970e43a5.avif?t=1745642842\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465080/extras_big/9f806ec11890885afc9d8be5970e43a5.avif?t=1745642842 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf81 <strong>Add More 2 Colors - MINT AND GREY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465080/extras/5653f624e3ea569698c1c8638c98f393.avif?t=1745642842\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465080/extras_big/5653f624e3ea569698c1c8638c98f393.avif?t=1745642842 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf81 <strong>New Guest Characters \u2013 From Holiday Farm!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Celebrate the chaos with two special guest characters from <i>Holiday Farm</i>! These festive visitors bring a fresh vibe (and a few surprises) into the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465080/extras/e38e3000425851f99e9d4bc592f888bf.avif?t=1745642842\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465080/extras_big/e38e3000425851f99e9d4bc592f888bf.avif?t=1745642842 width=800 height=450 /></span>\ud83e\udd16 <strong>Adorable (but Deadly) Monsters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t be fooled by their cute looks\u2014these robotic dungeon dwellers are here to ruin your run! Each monster in <i>Dungeon Bomb</i> is uniquely designed with charm and personality, but you\u2019ll need sharp reflexes (and well-placed bombs) to survive their onslaught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The First Bomb","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3465080/9e12aa0128bd6ce04bc0d9e92248abbf3a4475a3.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat First Enemy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3465080/9e12aa0128bd6ce04bc0d9e92248abbf3a4475a3.jpg"},{"name":"First Dead","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/stea